# Frontend

Read `.cursor/skills/senior-frontend/SKILL.md` and `.cursor/skills/senior-ui-ux/SKILL.md` before editing UI.

- TypeScript strict. No `any`. Derive state; do not duplicate server data in `useState`.
- User-facing locators: roles, labels, names. No CSS-class tests.
- Verify the changed flow in the browser before claiming done.
